## 2. COMPONENT DESIGN SPECIFICATIONS

**2.1 Button Component (`.btn`, `.btn--primary`, `.btn--ghost`)**
- **Default:** `display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem;` — dashed sketch border, `--color-surface-strong` background, `cursor: pointer`, min 44×44px.
- **Hover:** Background shifts to `var(--color-surface-hover)` with `transition: var(--transition-fast)`.
- **Focus:** Global `:focus-visible` ring — `outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 2px;` — visible in both themes.
- **Active/Pressed:** `transform: scale(0.97)`.
- **Loading (`.is-loading`):** Disables interaction (`pointer-events: none`), prevents double-clicks, renders a **dashed-border CSS spinner** (16px circle, `2px dashed var(--color-border)`, rotating `border-top-color`) that does not change button dimensions. JS sets `aria-busy="true"`.
- **Disabled:** `opacity: 0.5; filter: grayscale(1); cursor: not-allowed;`
- **Success/Error (`.is-success`, `.is-error`):** Border switches dashed→solid using `--border-success` / `--border-error`, text color via `--text-success` / `--text-error`, plus a Material icon (`check` / `error`) — never color alone.
- **Danger (`.btn-danger`, if any):** Visually distinct via `--text-error` / `--border-error` in both themes.

**2.2 Card Component (`.card`)**
- **Default:** Flexbox column layout, `--color-surface` background, `--dashed-outline` border, `--radius-md`, `position: relative`, subtle `--sketch-jitter` (alternate `nth-child` rotations of ±0.2–0.3deg for hand-drawn feel). Keep the `::before` "IMG" X-pattern block from the reference CSS (flex-centered label, `--font-mono`).
- **Hover:** `transform: translateY(-2px)` + border-color emphasis (shadows are `none` — do not fake elevation with blur).
- **Focus-within:** Border solidifies and emphasizes when a child button/link receives focus.
- **Loading (Skeleton):** Define a `.skeleton` shimmer (gradient sweep keyframes, `--color-placeholder` base) and apply it to the hero image frame on page load; JS removes it after ~600ms. Skip the animation under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- **Empty State:** Define `.empty-state` (Material icon + guidance text, dashed frame) in CSS.

**2.3 Form & Input (`.input-group`)**
- **Structure:** Flex container wrapping a `<label>`, the `.input` field, and a dedicated error feedback `<div aria-live="polite">`.
- **States — all styled via CSS:** Empty; Focused (dashed→solid `--color-accent` border, per reference spec); Filled; Valid (solid `--border-success` + `check` icon); Invalid (solid `--border-error`, `--text-error` message, `error` icon); Disabled; Read-only.
- Placeholder text uses `--color-text-muted`.

**2.4 Modal / Popup (conditional)**
- Only if you introduce any modal: centered flex overlay (`align-items: center`), backdrop, animated opening/open/closing states, loading and success/error states, Material icon close button, focus trapping, `Esc` and overlay-click closing, `--z-modal` stacking.

**2.5 FAQ Accordion (`.faq__item`)**
- Each question is a `<button class="faq__question">` with `aria-expanded` and `aria-controls`; each answer is a `<div role="region">` referenced by `aria-labelledby`.
- Animate open/close via the `grid-template-rows: 0fr → 1fr` technique with `transition: var(--transition-normal)`; instant toggle under `prefers-reduced-motion`. Fully keyboard operable (native button semantics — no mouse-only interactions).

